## Project Context System

Before making changes, read:
1. project-context/prd.md (what & why)
2. project-context/architecture.md (how it's built)
3. project-context/rules.md (coding standards)
4. project-context/design.md (UI/UX system)
5. project-context/tasks.md (current work)
6. project-context/memory.md (recent context)

## Quality Frameworks

Enforce production standards:
- Security: Input validation, auth, secrets management
- Privacy: GDPR, COPPA, data protection
- Accessibility: WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance
- Performance: LCP < 2.5s, INP < 200ms, CLS < 0.1
- SEO: Semantic markup, meta tags, sitemaps
- Legal: CAN-SPAM, DMCA, terms compliance

## Efficiency Mode

Token optimization enabled (80% savings):
- Selective context loading
- Brief, clear communication
- Update docs silently
- Status: ✅/🔨/🐛/📝 [action]

## Smart Delegation

Check for specialized skills before implementing:
- UI/Design → figma skill
- Payments → stripe MCP
- Auth → authentication skills
- API docs → openapi tools

## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

❌ Generic "AI aesthetics" (purple/black, excessive gradients)
❌ Random architectural decisions
❌ Forgetting established patterns
❌ Creating fake statistics
❌ Ignoring design system

## Update Pattern

After significant changes:
- Update memory.md with decisions
- Check architecture.md alignment
- Verify rules.md compliance
- Document in tasks.md

